graph SECURITY_PRIVACY 1
entry SECURITY-001

gate SECURITY-001
context CODE_CHANGE
question "Are inputs, permissions, secrets, private data, and isolation handled according to the admitted security boundary?"
evidence threats,permissions,secrets,isolation
YES SECURITY-002
NO HARD-STOP-SECURITY
UNKNOWN HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-SECURITY
end

gate SECURITY-002
context CLOSURE
question "Are destructive, external, and release actions held for the Runtime authority with an exact bounded request?"
evidence authority,actions,request
YES SECURITY-003
NO HARD-STOP-SECURITY
UNKNOWN HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-SECURITY
end

gate SECURITY-003
context CODE_CHANGE
question "Does every protected operation require the right identity and reject missing, foreign, expired, or downgraded authority?"
evidence permissions,authorization,negative
YES SECURITY-004
NO HARD-STOP-SECURITY
UNKNOWN HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-SECURITY
end

gate SECURITY-004
context CODE_CHANGE
question "Do untrusted inputs fail safely against injection, path traversal, SSRF, unsafe commands, and cross-project access?"
evidence inputs,threats,isolation,negative
YES SECURITY-005
NO HARD-STOP-SECURITY
UNKNOWN HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-SECURITY
end

gate SECURITY-005
context RESPONSE
question "Do user-facing responses, logs, handoffs, and evidence redact secrets, private paths, credentials, and unrelated project content?"
evidence secrets,content,response
YES SECURITY-006
NO HARD-STOP-SECURITY
UNKNOWN HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-SECURITY
end

gate SECURITY-006
context CLOSURE
question "Are external, destructive, financial, deployment, merge, and release actions blocked until Runtime has a matching owner-approved request?"
evidence authority,actions,request,permissions
YES COMPLETE
NO HARD-STOP-SECURITY
UNKNOWN HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-SECURITY
end

terminal COMPLETE COMPLETE "The security and privacy boundary is satisfied."
terminal HARD-STOP-SECURITY HARD_STOP "Security, privacy, or authority evidence failed."
terminal HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE HARD_STOP "Security cannot proceed on unknown evidence."
